  "bio": "Haley Gogue is a master tattoo artist, specializing in illustrative styles that bring unique stories to life on skin. With a casual attitude reflected in her balance of raising a kid and hanging out with chickens, she combines friendliness with unparalleled artistry that makes each tattoo session a comfortable and enjoyable journey.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nHen House Tattoo    Grants Pass, OR    by appointment only.     email haley@henhousetattoo.com\n\nHen House Tattoo    Grants Pass, OR    by appointment only.     email haley@henhousetattoo.com",
